OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FHigh
OL,6,Fpressure continues to dominate in the
OL,7,Fcoming days, bringing largely cloudy
OL,8,Fconditions with isolated showers, and
OL,9,Fan easterly breeze. Temperatures
OL,10,Fremain around normal for the time of
OL,11,Fyear.
